WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:04.830
Jubefl.

00:12.970 --> 00:17.050
As soon as you've awoken, the
Hiruko Clan falls to its demise.

00:17.760 --> 00:19.780
How ironic.

00:19.810 --> 00:22.280
But your needless
bond has also been cut.

00:22.310 --> 00:24.810
All in all, a happy
turn of events.

00:26.770 --> 00:29.070
How utterly joyful.

00:31.570 --> 00:32.570
Up there.

00:34.990 --> 00:37.910
The future rests on what
happens on that mountain.

02:08.960 --> 02:14.880
<i>Episode 13 Farewell Jubei.</i>

02:33.230 --> 02:36.690
Now it's the Light
Maiden's turn.

03:04.600 --> 03:08.270
Now search in your
memory. Of the olden days.

03:35.750 --> 03:39.100
Ah. The song of the ancients.

03:39.130 --> 03:41.940
The memory of the ancient
kingdom that lay dormant

03:41.970 --> 03:44.220
with the Light Maiden
has been awakened.

03:53.940 --> 03:57.320
<i>This song... I've</i>
heard this before.

04:25.180 --> 04:27.350
Go inside.

04:27.890 --> 04:30.180
You want to know, don't you?

04:31.140 --> 04:33.020
Who you really are.

04:38.690 --> 04:41.940
The answer lies
beyond this opening.

04:47.700 --> 04:49.840
Do as I have instructed
you beforehand.

04:49.870 --> 04:51.540
Yes, sir. Let's go!

04:57.380 --> 05:00.460
Dammit, what am I
supposed do now?

05:02.460 --> 05:04.510
Ahhh! Wait a minute!

05:05.720 --> 05:06.720
Huh?

05:07.390 --> 05:10.390
Jubefl C'mon, let's go!

05:12.810 --> 05:15.480
Hey? What? What are we gonna do?

05:16.520 --> 05:19.690
It's the Yagyus! Don't
let them get ahead of us!

05:31.700 --> 05:33.290
Come on!

05:39.580 --> 05:41.000
Charge!

05:47.260 --> 05:48.800
'Souse me, just passin' by.

05:50.140 --> 05:52.570
Man, scary!

05:52.600 --> 05:57.280
Hey, old man,
doesn't that thorn hurt?

05:57.310 --> 06:01.660
Hmm? Oh, this?
Didn't work at all.

06:01.690 --> 06:05.110
It took some acting
to look like it did.

06:12.160 --> 06:15.300
As I figured, your neck
is tenacious as well.

06:15.330 --> 06:18.000
You old fart...

06:19.290 --> 06:23.960
You need to fool your
friends to fool your enemies.

06:31.970 --> 06:34.810
I saved those female ninjas.

06:35.310 --> 06:37.490
Aren't they both beauties?

06:37.520 --> 06:39.020
Dirty old man.

06:41.560 --> 06:43.030
No one goes beyond this point!

06:43.060 --> 06:44.980
Stop, under orders
from the government!

06:50.660 --> 06:52.320
Get out of my way!

06:55.740 --> 06:56.740
Follow him!

06:59.080 --> 07:01.300
Here and there. Here and there.

07:01.330 --> 07:04.140
Tsubute! You go ahead, too!

07:04.170 --> 07:07.050
That goes without saying.

07:19.230 --> 07:21.550
The Maiden is going
forward as though she is

07:21.580 --> 07:23.870
being pulled by the
memory of the ancients.

07:23.900 --> 07:26.110
It seems that is so.

07:26.690 --> 07:29.330
By the way, are you aware?

07:29.360 --> 07:30.330
Yes.

07:30.360 --> 07:32.490
Udayuu, Sadayuu.

07:54.220 --> 07:55.390
Disperse!

08:06.230 --> 08:08.650
My |°Td, go now!

08:19.370 --> 08:20.370
Gunbei!

08:27.380 --> 08:29.340
Thank heaven that's over.

08:32.470 --> 08:36.050
Hotta, Kawabe, Satomi...

08:37.140 --> 08:39.680
Let's move. Before
Yamikubo gets too far.

09:27.400 --> 09:29.160
It is behind this?

09:29.190 --> 09:30.650
Yes.

09:33.150 --> 09:37.500
<i>I don't know what
is behind this door.</i>

09:37.530 --> 09:41.200
<i>But... I have a feeling
I've seen it before.</i>

09:42.620 --> 09:45.750
<i>This is the memory
of the Light Maiden.</i>

09:48.750 --> 09:51.960
Now, Maiden. Open the door.

09:52.380 --> 09:54.630
And see for yourself!

10:18.400 --> 10:19.950
Oh, this is...

10:47.230 --> 10:48.450
Uh-huh...

10:48.480 --> 10:53.440
I see something like
a tomb or an island.

10:54.730 --> 10:57.440
Do you suppose that
the treasure is out there?

11:04.080 --> 11:06.660
Oh, damn, it's so narrow here.

11:08.580 --> 11:09.580
Huh?!

11:09.960 --> 11:11.670
Oh, man...

11:17.420 --> 11:19.670
Heaven protect me...

11:22.010 --> 11:23.680
Ouch!

11:25.810 --> 11:27.850
It's you, old fart.

11:29.390 --> 11:31.950
What happened to the Yagyu
Clan? Did you kill 'em all?

11:31.980 --> 11:33.280
You're kidding.

11:33.310 --> 11:36.700
Can't deal with all of them,
so I split when I got a chance.

11:36.730 --> 11:37.730
Yeah.

11:37.980 --> 11:42.200
I'm sure the Yagyus and the Kimons are
knocking each other dead as we speak.

12:21.280 --> 12:24.710
What an elaborate
contraption, Yamidoro.

12:24.740 --> 12:25.740
Yes.

12:26.320 --> 12:29.420
With this, even I can get
across to the other side.

12:29.450 --> 12:30.500
Aye, sir.

12:34.080 --> 12:38.500
<i>From here on, do as
you wish, dear Maiden.</i>

12:39.920 --> 12:41.300
<i>As you wish...</i>

12:49.470 --> 12:50.900
Yamidoro...

12:50.930 --> 12:54.020
I must finish the
battle with you!

12:55.020 --> 12:56.980
Couldn't even go to
hell like you should've.

12:59.980 --> 13:00.980
Mufu!

13:01.440 --> 13:02.440
Yamidoro!

13:07.070 --> 13:08.160
Yamidoro...

13:11.660 --> 13:13.080
Judgment from heaven!

13:18.290 --> 13:20.840
Hey, how's it going?

13:26.470 --> 13:28.140
What are you surprised about?

13:28.720 --> 13:30.470
I'm not a ghost, you know.

13:36.690 --> 13:37.850
Who cares!

13:39.400 --> 13:43.080
Well, well. You're
alive, Jubei Kibagami.

13:43.110 --> 13:45.490
This time in alliance
with the Yagyus.

13:46.110 --> 13:48.840
Head of the Kimon Clan!

13:48.870 --> 13:51.250
Your lord is done with.

13:51.280 --> 13:54.000
Any further fighting is useless!

13:55.960 --> 13:58.830
Carry on. After
all, I am a shadow.

13:59.790 --> 14:00.880
As you wish.

14:09.260 --> 14:11.260
You... a shadow decoy?!

14:14.520 --> 14:19.810
Lord Yamikubo cannot be
defeated by an amateur like you!

14:24.400 --> 14:25.440
Shigure!

14:28.700 --> 14:29.740
They're calling me.

14:30.160 --> 14:31.530
Shigure!

14:36.120 --> 14:38.890
I won't allow you to
have the Hiruko treasure.

14:38.920 --> 14:40.790
Fool, what are
you talking about?!

14:44.460 --> 14:50.060
I see that the Hiruko treasure is that
young woman, the Light Maiden herself.

14:50.090 --> 14:51.560
What?!

14:51.590 --> 14:55.640
You saw her power
in creating that bridge.

14:57.850 --> 15:01.350
That is the extraordinary
power inherited from the ancients.

15:01.850 --> 15:04.860
The proof of her
ancient royal heritage...

15:05.940 --> 15:08.530
is her evil power bent
on destroying the world!

15:12.820 --> 15:13.670
Shut up!

15:13.700 --> 15:17.250
So, she moved a few
rocks and you call that evil?!

15:18.910 --> 15:23.180
Mufu, what will
the Maiden desire?

15:23.210 --> 15:24.460
Hmm?

15:24.920 --> 15:28.850
When she inherits
everything as the Light Maiden,

15:28.880 --> 15:32.390
which path shall that
young woman take?

15:32.930 --> 15:35.760
It will be up to her wishes!

15:39.930 --> 15:40.930
Is that so?

16:29.980 --> 16:32.240
I will return this to you.

16:43.080 --> 16:49.140
Who I am and what
my destiny is about...

16:49.170 --> 16:51.730
I know everything now.

16:51.760 --> 16:53.300
I want to live the present...

16:54.550 --> 16:57.140
as myself!

17:19.410 --> 17:20.450
Jubefl.

17:20.990 --> 17:22.420
Jubei, run!

17:22.450 --> 17:23.450
Shigure!

17:30.710 --> 17:32.350
The root of evil
must be extinguished!

17:32.380 --> 17:33.230
Move away!

17:33.260 --> 17:34.800
Fool!

17:35.550 --> 17:38.110
This place will collapse
soon. Get out, please!

17:38.140 --> 17:39.930
Collapse, she says!

17:42.680 --> 17:47.240
Unless I kill that young woman, the
blood of the ancient kingdom will remain.

17:47.270 --> 17:50.360
So what if it remains?

17:55.360 --> 17:58.360
I will not allow you to use
your quick-draw technique!

18:00.700 --> 18:02.030
Jubefl.

18:04.450 --> 18:05.620
Jubefl.

18:20.140 --> 18:21.890
Shigure, go!

18:22.350 --> 18:23.600
Get out!

18:33.980 --> 18:38.650
I see that the Light Maiden has
chosen to abandon her power.

18:40.700 --> 18:41.700
Yes.

18:41.950 --> 18:44.620
The Hiruko Clan
will also perish here.

18:48.250 --> 18:51.630
That may be a
good thing, brother.

18:56.380 --> 18:57.510
You're right.

19:16.190 --> 19:17.610
You're up?

19:19.400 --> 19:20.490
Are you okay?

19:23.070 --> 19:25.030
Where am I?!

19:28.500 --> 19:29.500
Jubei?

19:37.760 --> 19:39.090
JubeL.

19:41.090 --> 19:44.640
Jubefl.

19:59.530 --> 20:00.650
Hmm.

20:03.950 --> 20:05.840
Uncharacteristic of me.

20:05.870 --> 20:08.510
To think back about them...

20:08.540 --> 20:10.580
It's been a while...

20:33.060 --> 20:35.350
Here goes!

20:38.360 --> 20:42.990
Oh, man, now why do
I have to be doing this?

20:43.700 --> 20:46.320
I can't laugh at
Tatsunosuke anymore.

20:48.200 --> 20:50.510
But you're hoeing
like an old pro.

20:50.540 --> 20:52.220
You look great.

20:52.250 --> 20:54.040
Knock it off!

20:54.830 --> 20:59.800
But you know, you're not gonna be
here growing vegetables forever, are you?

21:00.250 --> 21:02.060
Traveling was great, wasn't it?

21:02.090 --> 21:03.550
So whassup?

21:05.970 --> 21:07.860
Well, yes.

21:07.890 --> 21:11.100
I'll think about it when I
get to that fork in the road.

21:13.140 --> 21:15.390
For now, living like this
has its charms doesn't it?

21:16.440 --> 21:21.000
Well, yeah... No way, man!

21:21.030 --> 21:24.920
I want to do something big
that makes lots of money!

21:24.950 --> 21:26.910
No way would I keep doing this.

21:31.910 --> 21:36.750
Wherever you go, the sky is
the sky, and people are people...

21:44.720 --> 21:47.930
Well... let's get going.

21:50.180 --> 21:54.520
Wherever you go, the sky is
the sky, and people are people.
